# v6.0.0 — dev-only files excluded from public ship.
# These remain in the local working tree (untrack ≠ delete) but are not
# part of what users get on `npx skills add` or `git clone`. See v6.0.0
# CHANGELOG entry "Smaller install footprint" for rationale.
tests/*
# Tracked exception: the v8.0 startup-latency baseline instrument. A measurement
# whose script lives only in a working tree cannot be re-derived by a reviewer,
# so this one ships with the repo the way .scripts/release-publish.sh does.
!tests/startup-latency-probe.sh
# Tracked exception: the source-edit guard regression suite. Three release gates
# lean on it — Step 2a hook verification in claudedocs/release-process.md checks
# the same guard logic this suite automates, and the v8 plan names the suite by
# command in both its Phase 2 testing strategy and its Validation checklist. A
# gate whose suite exists only in one working tree cannot be run from a fresh
# clone.
!tests/guard-regression.sh
# Tracked exception: the session-ceremony hook harness and its fixtures. This is the
# only test covering hooks/lib/session-ceremony.sh, which the Stop hook loads on every
# turn, and four plan documents in specs/ name it by command as verification evidence.
# A gate whose suite exists only in one working tree cannot be run from a fresh clone.
!tests/session-ceremony-trigger.sh
!tests/fixtures/
tests/fixtures/*
!tests/fixtures/session-ceremony/
.lint-allowlist
.scanner-exceptions.json
hooks/lib/
